BT /F2 11 Tf 54 614 Td (1.1 A note from our CEO) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 592 Td (Welcome to Meridian Instruments. Whether you have joined us in Leeds, Rotterdam, Austin or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 579 Td (Penang, you are now part of a team of around 1,400 people who design, build and support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 566 Td (equipment that keeps industrial sites safe and running. Our gas detectors protect people in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 553 Td (confined spaces, our vibration monitoring warns engineers before a bearing fails, and our flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (meters help customers use less energy and water. The work matters, and so do the people who do) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 527 Td (it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 505 Td (This handbook is meant to be practical. It will not answer every question, but it should tell) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 492 Td (you where to look and who to ask. Please read it during your first two weeks and keep coming) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 479 Td (back to it. If something is unclear or out of date, tell the People Team so that the next) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 466 Td (edition is better.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 444 Td (Priya Raman, Chief Executive Officer) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 421 Td (1.2 How to use this handbook) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 399 Td (The handbook summarises how we work and points to the formal policies that sit behind each) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 386 Td (topic. Where a formal policy exists, the policy takes precedence over this summary. Policies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 373 Td (are published in Keel, our HR portal, under Keel > Documents > Policies, and each has a policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 360 Td (code such as POL-HR-022 or POL-FIN-007. Local employment law always applies, and where a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 347 Td (country supplement or a regional policy gives you a more favourable term, that term applies to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 334 Td (you.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 312 Td (This handbook does not form part of your contract of employment unless your contract says so.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 299 Td (Meridian may update it from time to time, and the current version is always the one published) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 286 Td (in Keel.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 263 Td (1.3 Who to ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 241 Td (For most employment questions, start with your line manager. For questions about pay, leave,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 228 Td (benefits, policies or your employment record, contact the People Help service centre at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 215 Td (peoplehelp@meridian-instruments.example. For IT problems, including trouble logging in to Keel,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 202 Td (raise a ticket in Beacon, our IT service desk. A full contacts list is in section 12.) Tj ET
