BT /F2 11 Tf 54 426 Td (2.5 Our values) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 404 Td (Our four values are Precision, Integrity, Care and Ownership. Precision means we measure twice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 391 Td (and get the detail right. Integrity means we do what we say and tell the truth when it is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 378 Td (inconvenient. Care means we look after our colleagues, our customers and the places we work.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 365 Td (Ownership means we take responsibility for outcomes rather than waiting to be asked. The Code) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 352 Td (of Conduct \(POL-CORP-001\) explains how these values translate into expected behaviour.) Tj ET
