BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (If you use a computer for a significant part of your working day, you should complete the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (display screen equipment \(DSE\) self-assessment in Keel within your first month and whenever) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (your workstation changes. Hybrid workers should also assess their home workstation. Equipment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690 Td (for home working can be requested from IT through Beacon.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 667 Td (8.6 First aid and fire safety) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 645 Td (Each site has trained first aiders and fire marshals, whose names and photographs are displayed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 632 Td (on noticeboards near the main entrances. If you would like to volunteer as a first aider or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619 Td (fire marshal, speak to your site facilities team; training is provided and paid for by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 606 Td (Meridian. Fire alarms are tested weekly at a set time at each site, and full evacuation drills) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 593 Td (take place at least twice a year.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 570 Td (8.7 Reporting accidents and near misses) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 548 Td (All accidents, injuries, dangerous occurrences and near misses must be reported within 24 hours) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 535 Td (using the incident reporting form on the Health and Safety intranet page, even if nobody was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 522 Td (hurt. Your manager and the site health and safety adviser will review the report and decide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 509 Td (whether an investigation is needed. Some incidents must be reported to the regulator in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 496 Td (relevant country, and the site health and safety adviser will handle this. Never alter the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 483 Td (scene of a serious incident except to make it safe or to help an injured person.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 460 Td (8.8 Wellbeing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (Your mental health matters as much as your physical health. Mental health first aiders are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 425 Td (available at every site, and the EAP is available at any time. Managers are expected to hold) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 412 Td (regular one-to-ones and to notice when a team member seems to be struggling. If you are worried) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 399 Td (about a colleague, speak to them, to your manager or to People Help.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 376 Td (8.9 Alcohol and drugs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 354 Td (You must not work under the influence of alcohol or drugs that could impair your performance or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 341 Td (safety. This is especially important in production, laboratory and driving roles. If you are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 328 Td (taking prescribed medication that might affect your ability to work safely, tell your manager) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 315 Td (or occupational health. Alcohol may be served at approved company events, but moderation and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 302 Td (good judgement are expected.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 277 Td (9. Conduct and Standards) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 254 Td (9.1 The Code of Conduct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 232 Td (The Code of Conduct \(POL-CORP-001\) sets out the standards of behaviour we expect from everyone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 219 Td (at Meridian, including rules on conflicts of interest, anti-bribery, gifts and hospitality,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 206 Td (competition law and trade compliance. All employees must complete Code of Conduct training when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 193 Td (they join and every year after that.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 170 Td (9.2 Dignity at work) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 148 Td (We are committed to a workplace free from harassment, bullying, discrimination and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 135 Td (victimisation. Everyone should be treated with courtesy and respect, regardless of age,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 122 Td (disability, gender identity, marital status, pregnancy, race, religion or belief, sex or sexual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 109 Td (orientation. Concerns can be raised with your manager, People Help, or through the Speak Up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 96 Td (channels described in POL-CORP-004.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 73 Td (9.3 Dress and appearance) Tj ET
