BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (There is no formal dress code in office areas. Please dress in a way that is appropriate for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (the day, particularly when meeting customers or visitors. In production and laboratory areas,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (clothing must be compatible with the required PPE, and loose jewellery and long hair must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690 Td (secured near moving machinery.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 667 Td (9.4 Personal relationships at work) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 645 Td (We recognise that close personal relationships sometimes develop between colleagues. If you are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 632 Td (in a close personal relationship with someone in your reporting line, or with someone whose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619 Td (work you approve, audit or pay, you must declare it using the Conflict of Interest Declaration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 606 Td (\(F-150\) so that we can make appropriate arrangements. The Code of Conduct gives more detail on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 593 Td (declarations.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 570 Td (9.5 Social media and public statements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 548 Td (You are welcome to share Meridian news on your personal social media accounts. Do not share) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 535 Td (confidential information, customer names without permission, or photographs taken in production) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 522 Td (or laboratory areas. Only authorised spokespeople may speak to the media on behalf of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 509 Td (company. Any media enquiry should be passed to the communications team.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 486 Td (9.6 Recognition and long-service awards) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 464 Td (We like to say thank you. Managers can nominate colleagues for quarterly Values Awards, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (each site holds a recognition event at the end of the fiscal year. We also mark long service) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (with awards on the anniversary of your start date, as follows:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 417 Td (Years of service | Award) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 405 Td (5 years | \243250 voucher) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 393 Td (10 years | \2431,000 plus 5 extra days of leave \(one-off\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 381 Td (20 years | \2432,500 plus 10 extra days of leave \(one-off\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 369 Td (25 years | \2434,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 347 Td (Awards outside the UK are paid in the local currency equivalent at the Group budget exchange) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 334 Td (rate. The extra days of leave are a one-off addition to your entitlement and should be taken) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 321 Td (within 12 months of the anniversary. Cash awards are paid through payroll and are subject to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 308 Td (tax and social security in the normal way.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 285 Td (9.7 Performance and development) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 263 Td (Every employee agrees objectives with their manager at the start of the fiscal year, has a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 250 Td (mid-year check-in in October, and a year-end review in April. Reviews are recorded in Keel. If) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 237 Td (performance falls short, your manager will first discuss it informally and agree support. Where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 224 Td (problems continue, the Disciplinary and Grievance Procedure \(POL-HR-040\) may apply.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 201 Td (9.8 Raising a grievance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 179 Td (If you have a concern about your work, working conditions or relationships with colleagues, try) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 166 Td (to resolve it informally with your manager first. If that does not work, you can raise a formal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 153 Td (grievance under POL-HR-040.) Tj ET
