BT /F1 10 Tf 54 474 Td (security@meridian-instruments.example within 24 hours so that it can be deactivated. The first) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 461 Td (replacement badge is issued free of charge. A second replacement within 12 months costs \24315 \(or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 448 Td (the local currency equivalent\), which is deducted from pay with your agreement. Temporary day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 435 Td (passes can be collected from reception while a replacement is printed, but they do not open) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (laboratory or production doors.) Tj ET
