BT /F1 10 Tf 54 377 Td (Laptops, phones and other equipment remain Meridian property. Look after them, keep them secure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 364 Td (when travelling, and return them when you leave or when asked. Loss or theft must be reported) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 351 Td (through Beacon straight away, and theft must also be reported to the police.) Tj ET
